.TH VIBEOS-MESSAGING-SMS 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-messaging-sms \- SMS service of VibeOS messaging
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-messaging-sms
.SH DESCRIPTION
Takes text messages off the modem through ModemManager, stores and notifies them, and sends messages, with the messaging app closed. It runs as the systemd user service vibeos-messaging-sms.service and owns vibeos.Messaging.Sms on the session bus.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-messaging(1), ModemManager(8)
